      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Purpose:** Trace search over sanitized spans (span events dropped, status descriptions cleared). Tempo here has no metrics generator, so views are searches, not rates.\n\n**Audience:** Developers investigating latency or failures.\n\n**Decision supported:** Which recent traces failed or were slow, so they can be opened for detail.\n"
      }
    },
